+| T036 | codex | redirect complete — raw map/feed/tape test + valid 8-worker third-land screen; full route needs a new early controller, no candidate. Never submit. | Boey/M&M&P&Q/DSM/fuxi crop, herd, fertilizer, quadrant and held-out aggregate-operation rules in `research/re_production.md`. |
+| T037 | codex | units layer ready; awaiting Claude plan integration | Standalone top-RE: review in `research/top_re_agent_plan_codex.md`; `lab/re/top_re/units.py` implements legal task generation, greedy assignment and movement. Claude owns plan/market/main. Never submit. |
